OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator fears for queer
OL,4,Arepresentation after BBC drops show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-creator of Drag Race has said
OL,7,Fthere is a "crisis of representation"
OL,8,Fon TV, following the BBC's decision to
OL,9,Faxe the UK edition of the show.
OL,11,FSpeaking exclusively to BBC News,
OL,12,FFenton Bailey said he did not believe
OL,13,Fthere was a "hidden agenda" behind the
OL,14,Fdecision, but feared "vulnerable
OL,15,Fcommunities are going to be even more
OL,16,Fvulnerable".
OL,18,FThe move led viewers to raise concerns
OL,19,Fabout the corporation's on-screen
OL,20,Frepresentation, after it also cancelled
OL,21,Ftwo LGBTQ+ dating shows.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
