OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator fears for queer
OL,4,Arepresentation after BBC drops show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the BBC said the
OL,7,Fdecision was down to "significant
OL,8,Ffinancial pressures", as it attempts to
OL,9,Fmake #500m of savings.
